        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/20/apple-gives-update-on-the-app-store-and-its-key-protections/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/app-store-connect-ios.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Ahead of Apple’s annual developer conference next month, Apple has <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/05/the-app-store-stopped-over-2-point-2-billion-usd-in-fraudulent-transactions-in-2025/\">shared an update</a> on how the App Store serves users and developers alike with numerous protections.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"app-store\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052834\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/20/apple-gives-update-on-the-app-store-and-its-key-protections/#more-1052834\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
