        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/15/apple-cash-is-down-for-some-iphone-users-in-the-u-s/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/01/apple-cash-ios-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p><strong>Update:</strong> Apple now lists the issue as resolved. The original story follows below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’ve been unable to use Apple Cash over the last few hours, you’re not alone, as the service is currently experiencing an outage affecting some users in the U.S. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-cash\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052455\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/15/apple-cash-is-down-for-some-iphone-users-in-the-u-s/#more-1052455\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
