        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/19/fortnite-is-back-on-the-app-store-worldwide-says-epic-games/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/Fortnite-is-back-on-the-App-Store-worldwide-says-Epic-Games.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1200\" /></div><p><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/epic-games/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Epic Games</a> has said that Fortnite is now back on the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/app-store/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">App Store</a> worldwide, although there is one notable exception.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The company has again criticized what it calls “junk fees” from <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/aapl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Apple</a> and indicated it expects to win an ongoing <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/antitrust/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">antitrust</a> lawsuit against the iPhone maker …</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,antitrust,epic-games,fortnite\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052674\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/19/fortnite-is-back-on-the-app-store-worldwide-says-epic-games/#more-1052674\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
