        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/20/hovercraft-is-a-new-mac-app-that-makes-video-call-presentations-feel-more-personal/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/Hovercraft.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>The simple act of sharing your screen in a way that feels natural during a video call can be overly complicated. Hovercraft is <a href=\"https://sandwich.vision/hovercraft\">a new Mac app</a> that solves a very specific problem around screen sharing during video calls.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,mac\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052878\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/20/hovercraft-is-a-new-mac-app-that-makes-video-call-presentations-feel-more-personal/#more-1052878\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
